			"text": "Concrete paving slabs for the connected buildings' sidewalks and floors (structures/buildings, tools/buildings), drawn on the board's axes (the kit JSON's repeat, 12 units): four by four slabs per repeat, each its own tone, sunk joints, mottling and stains. 512 px. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/buildings (or tools/materials/export.py), then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
